There will be a new update on September 8th.  We have fixed few bugs and added some requested features. And at the same time we will open a new server on Steam at 3 am EST September 8th. 

List of Updates:
1. Dreamland: reduced the requirements of completing; added type of monsters; Modified the Dreamland mission;
2. Treasure Hunting: modified battle;
3. Added hints for how to obtain EXP;
4. Added hints and rules for mastery, plunder, castle conquer etc.;
5. Modified difficulty of bosses;
6. Added hint if the castle has been attacked; 
7. Added useful hints by exiting the game;
8. Modified few translation;
9. Fixed few bugs. 

We will continue to add more features and new contents in the coming months. Thank you for supporting us!

Shadow of Kingdoms Team

